  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8554d0ea-cdd8-5de4-970a-ea286321cb88" activityNameId="c375c62d-512d-5a6d-a1c1-68d6faa12104" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cabinet panel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cabinet panel
This data set describes the production of a cabinet panel from literature source. Data stems from a LCA study. System boundaries include production of half-finished products, cutting, pressing (stanzen), drilling and flexing, degreasing, phosphatising, rinsing, drying, powder coating and burning in.;
UUID: 3eb3b159-8ce3-3f49-9408-6fecae196896
This data set describes the production of a cabinet panel including energy use, use of semi-finished products and working materials, waste treatment and transports of components.
Location: For processes abroad, electricity mix from UCTE is used, for Swiss processes electricity mix from Switzerland.
Technology: Cabinet panel made of galvanised steel plate with polyisocyanurat foam.
Time period: The literature source from 1999 uses LCA from 1994.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: no extrapolations
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3eb3b159-8ce3-3f49-9408-6fecae196896.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
